        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47,\r\rWe have good reason to believe that the Hospital Director and the guard are responsible for the past few patients deaths that were in good health but challenging the Hospitals methods of treatment. The hospital has also recieved many bad reviews about the Yoga Instuctor and to keep a good reputation I think it would be a good idea to take care of him to keep the customers happy. Make sure to keep this job quiet as we don&apos;t want any unwanted attention.\r\rHappy Hunting 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.7.0.0",
